>
>> function (defined in
>> lib/find_last_bit.c) in a file in the fs/nfs directory. =A0Myself and
>> another developer (though no one else so far) get the following error
>> during compile:
>>
>> =A0 =A0Kernel: arch/x86/boot/bzImage is ready =A0(#5)
>> =A0 =A0 =A0Building modules, stage 2.
>> =A0 =A0 =A0MODPOST 515 modules
>> =A0 =A0ERROR: "find_last_bit" [fs/nfs/nfs.ko] undefined!
